    "product_description": {
      "paragraph_list": [
        {
          "text": "📢Features: ",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "1, Optimized Design for Deep Breathing:The aerosol breathing belt is intelligently designed with a perfect opening and two-flow airway, ensuring ideal resistance for your exhalation. This design promotes deep and focused breathing, helping you achieve a feeling of calm and relaxation.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "2, Conuous Reminder to Breathe Deeply:Wearing a breathing necklace will conuously remind you to breathe more fully thout the day. It helps you consciously focus on your breathing, which is especially beneficial for people dealing with anxiety or stress.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "3, How to Use:The aerosol breathing belt is an effective tool for controlling anxiety. By inhaling slowly and deeply for 4 seconds, holding for 7 seconds, and then exhaling slowly th the breathlace for 8 to 10 seconds, you can engage in calming breathing exercises that can significantly reduce anxiety and promote relaxation.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "4, Natural Inner Peace:The Breathing Necklace offers a natural and scientifically proven way to find inner peace th repeated, controlled breathing.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
